{"about_the_game":"SuperWEIRD is a roguelite about automation, building, and survival. It combines easy-to-learn automation mechanics with deep gameplay, where perfectionists can spend hours improving and optimizing production chains.<br><br>In this game, there are no right or wrong decisions \u2014 you can always start over and try a new strategy. Most importantly, it\u2019s more fun with friends: play solo or with up to 4 players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You need more bots</h2>Goofy Goo is strong \u2014 you won\u2019t defeat it alone. You\u2019ll need an army of rusty, clumsy lemming-like robots.<br>Control your bots by marking paths and task points with flags. Build complex production chains to craft increasingly advanced and powerful weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the corruption</h2>On your journey, you\u2019ll face many enemies: the vile Goofy Goo, who broke the planet apart, will get in your way \u2014 sending giant robo-bosses and smaller disgusting creatures. It also devours resources and constructions, making life difficult for everyone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece the planet back together</h2>A SuperWEIRD planet has fallen apart into hundreds of fragments. It\u2019s up to you to piece it back together!<br>Experiment, combine, and create your own unique world \u2014 this is a true sandbox, where every fragment can be used in your own way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the locals</h2>On the planet\u2019s remains, you\u2019ll rescue the locals from corruption. They\u2019ll settle at your base and ask for all kinds of strange favors \u2014 like fetching \u201cthe third claw from the left\u201d of a boss. In return, these quirky aliens will reward you with goodies, such as extra health, larger stacks, and increased speed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op</h2>Play solo or together with friends, both online or on a local server.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who we are?</h2> We\u2019re the developers of while True: learn(), Craftomation 101, and Learning Factory.<br>We make systemic games about programming and automation, and this time, we\u2019ve finally decided to mix programming with co-op gameplay!<br>If you love system-driven games, follow us and add our new title to your wishlist!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818770?t=1774018340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/bee6a3dafaaf10c53a53872135d2f2fb9c83adef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774018340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/e500b77172bafdf28c0ed290c4719e122b7c6162/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774018340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/e500b77172bafdf28c0ed290c4719e122b7c6162/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774018340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"SuperWEIRD is a roguelite about automation, building, and survival. It combines easy-to-learn automation mechanics with deep gameplay, where perfectionists can spend hours improving and optimizing production chains.<br><br>In this game, there are no right or wrong decisions \u2014 you can always start over and try a new strategy. Most importantly, it\u2019s more fun with friends: play solo or with up to 4 players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You need more bots</h2>Goofy Goo is strong \u2014 you won\u2019t defeat it alone. You\u2019ll need an army of rusty, clumsy lemming-like robots.<br>Control your bots by marking paths and task points with flags. Build complex production chains to craft increasingly advanced and powerful weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/1f05c04d774191c6efa4b9abdd5e3ab8.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the corruption</h2>On your journey, you\u2019ll face many enemies: the vile Goofy Goo, who broke the planet apart, will get in your way \u2014 sending giant robo-bosses and smaller disgusting creatures. It also devours resources and constructions, making life difficult for everyone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/b16e54fceb90aab78bbd9816cfe7a0d1.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece the planet back together</h2>A SuperWEIRD planet has fallen apart into hundreds of fragments. It\u2019s up to you to piece it back together!<br>Experiment, combine, and create your own unique world \u2014 this is a true sandbox, where every fragment can be used in your own way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/a77482bdebd88fd6ed7b77a3cc4fa767.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the locals</h2>On the planet\u2019s remains, you\u2019ll rescue the locals from corruption. They\u2019ll settle at your base and ask for all kinds of strange favors \u2014 like fetching \u201cthe third claw from the left\u201d of a boss. In return, these quirky aliens will reward you with goodies, such as extra health, larger stacks, and increased speed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op</h2>Play solo or together with friends, both online or on a local server.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.poster.avif?t=1774018340\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.webm?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/extras/0f8228c5178e45f6957c7cec5454c595.mp4?t=1774018340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who we are?</h2> We\u2019re the developers of while True: learn(), Craftomation 101, and Learning Factory.<br>We make systemic games about programming and automation, and this time, we\u2019ve finally decided to mix programming with co-op gameplay!<br>If you love system-driven games, follow us and add our new title to your wishlist!","developers":["Luden.io"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/03f244f28732cd1c3d265dffad3b5b255cb8b1f9/header.jpg?t=1774018340","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SuperWEIRD. All rights reserved. All trademarks and registered trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+, SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818770/798877016/d4a3decf73889ddd77b32d6de58826e2bae636e2/1772792078/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772792782","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818770/798877016/d4a3decf73889ddd77b32d6de58826e2bae636e2/1772792078/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772792782","highlight":true,