8340","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818770/62b828bb45e44eb48b98e7ce40691d47f7c0bf72/ss_62b828bb45e44eb48b98e7ce40691d47f7c0bf72.600x338.jpg?t=1774018340"}],"short_description":"An automation roguelite where single-use JunkDroids turn out to be surprisingly useful: automate production network, rebuild a broken world piece by piece, and stop the Goofy Goo before it consumes everything. Play solo or in coop.","steam_appid":3818770,"support_info":{"email":"info@luden.io","url":"https://luden.io"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Arabic","type":"game","website":"https://superweird.io"}